{{Quote|Sifo, do you remember the cleansing ritual I taught you?''"<br />"''No.''"<br />"''On Rishi. After we uncovered the Hand of Skrye.|Lene Kostana and Sifo-Dyas|<ref name="Jedi Lost">''[[Dooku: Jedi Lost]]''</ref>}}
'''Rishi''' was a [[planet]] located in the [[Abrion sector]]'s<ref name="Ultimate" /> [[Rishi system]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Rookies" /> [[Orbit]]ed by the [[Rishi Moon]],<ref name="Ultimate" /> Rishi sat at S-15 on the [[Standard Galactic Grid]].<ref name="TFABG" /> It contained deposits of [[exonium]] and was home to the [[Rishii]] [[species]].<ref name="Mustafar and Other Outer Rim Planets" />

During the [[Republic Era]], Jedi Master [[Lene Kostana]] and her [[Padawan]], [[Sifo-Dyas]], discovered the [[Hand of Skrye]] on Rishi, and while on the planet, Kostana taught her apprentice a [[Ritual of the Three|cleansing ritual]].<ref name="Jedi Lost" /> Later, during the time of the [[Clone Wars]], the Rishi [[Moon]] housed a [[Galactic Republic]] [[listening post]] known as the [[Rishi Station]], which was [[Defense of Rishi Station|invaded]] by the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] led by [[Kaleesh]] [[General]] [[Grievous]]<ref name="Rookies" /> in [[22 BBY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' places the events of the [[Star Wars: The Clone Wars (film)|''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' film]] and "[[Bombad Jedi]]" to [[22 BBY]]. As the episode "[[Rookies (episode)|Rookies]]" takes place between these two pieces of media according to {{SW|url=news/star-wars-the-clone-wars-chronological-episodeorder|text=''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' Chronological Episode Order}}, the events of the episode must also take place in 22 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|BBY]].</ref> In order to get backup to assist them, the Republic [[clone trooper]]s destroyed the listening post.<ref name="Rookies" /> 

==Behind the scenes==
Rishi first appeared in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] in "[[Rookies (episode)|Rookies]],"<ref name="Rookies" /> the fifth episode of the [[The Clone Wars: Season One|first season]] of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series, which aired on [[October 24]], [[2008]].<ref name="Rookies Ep Guide">{{SWArchive|url=theclonewars/guide/episode005.html|text=''The Clone Wars'' Episode Guide: Rookies}}</ref> [[Rishi/Legends|Rishi]] originally appeared in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity in ''[[Dark Force Rising]]'', a [[1992]] novel authored by [[Timothy Zahn]] as the second volume of ''[[Star Wars: The Thrawn Trilogy]]''.<ref name="Dark Force Rising">''[[Dark Force Rising]]''</ref>

